# NOTE: .reuse/ and REUSE.toml are deliberately NOT excluded above. The
# licensing of l10n/*.json (can't carry an in-file header, it's JSON),
# l10n/*.js and js/*.js (generated, no SPDX header of their own) is declared
# ONLY in these two files -- shipping the tarball without them makes it
# fail `reuse lint` on its own even though the git repo passes. Confirmed
# by extracting a packaged tarball and linting it directly (2026-09-04).

